    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "English and History Double Major",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "English and History Double Major",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/arts/english_history/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "A total of nine (9) courses are required from Core Elective Table II. English: A total of four (4) ENG courses must be taken. History: A total of five (5) HIS courses* must be taken."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "NOTE: Every course will not be offered every semester."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "English Courses"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Students may opt for depth by selecting courses within thematic categories, or may opt for breadth by sampling broadly across those categories. Students considering Graduate studies are strongly advised to meet regularly with the Program Director to plan their course of study to ensure sufficient breadth and depth requirements."
    },
